{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness","id":171166,"title":"Musical Themes for the World of Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-16T16:28:04-07:00","id":171166,"title":"Musical Themes for the World of Darkness","content":"Think it's about time to revive this game.<br /> <br /> To put it simply, I link a music video or mp3, then the poster below me describes a thing nWoD that could have that song as a theme. Then <i>they </i>link a theme, and the poster below them describes something that could link to that, and so on.<br /> <br /> I'll get the ball rolling by an easy one, seeing as how it describes 60% of all mundane antagonist factions in both WoDs.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_EPcA2aovSY\" data-code=\"_EPcA2aovSY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_EPcA2aovSY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T19:20:47-07:00","id":171306,"title":"","content":"That really is an easy one. <b>Dirty Rotten Filthy Stinking Rich: Seers of the Throne.</b> I'm not sure I even have to explain this one, do I? The Seers of the Throne seek ownership as they are owned themselves; magic is power and they will use that power to get whatever they want.<br /> <br /> Let's look over my playlist and see out of the set of songs I've remembered to rate, looking at the highest ratings...<br /> <br /> Ah. Now let's crank the difficulty up a notch. <b>The New Pollution. </b><i>What do you see in the ink?</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uxugaMpt1vU\" data-code=\"uxugaMpt1vU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/uxugaMpt1vU/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:06:21-07:00","id":173351,"title":"","content":"<br /> <b>The New Pollution</b> is obviously about spirits specifically nature spirits that are being displaced by new spirits born of technology. They view the new types of essence and spirit created from it as pollution but forget that is how spirits of stone fire and magma thought of them when life began to overshadow them.<br /> <br /> What of the World of Darkness do you hear do you hear in <b>Black Water</b>?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YlfJlllq5EA\" data-code=\"YlfJlllq5EA\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/YlfJlllq5EA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1544,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1544-vectorfox","user":"VectorFox","date":". 06-18-2014, 08:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1544-vectorfox","name":"VectorFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1544_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:40:57-07:00","id":173386,"title":"","content":"<b>Black Water: </b>The <b>Ordo Dracul, </b>reflecting on the darker things for their quest for ascenscion to see the sunshine again, and the ultimate joy of having done so. Through mellow rock, because they're fans of the unexpected.<br /> <br /> Now that that's done with, how about <b>Gamma Unchained</b>, as part of my love affair with video game music?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OO8To_XZsFE\" data-code=\"OO8To_XZsFE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/OO8To_XZsFE/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T11:30:35-07:00","id":174368,"title":"","content":"<b>Coming Undone</b> by Korn for low-Clarity <b>Changelings</b>. Only listening to the music, I picture that Changeling in the art for Clarity in <b>The Lost</b> core book. There's also a great <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b7jVP-Mamq4\" target=\"_blank\">Nightcore remix of <b>Coming Undone </b></a>at that link.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CSJXle3LP_Q\" data-code=\"DCSJXle3LP_Q\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/DCSJXle3LP_Q/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> EDIT: I misunderstood the premise, and I apologize.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":1923,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","user":"BigDamnHero","date":". 06-19-2014, 02:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T11:44:13-07:00","id":174400,"title":"","content":"<b>Gamma Unchained</b> is certainly about Demon. Unchained is literally in the songs title, the opening has a wierd digital voice in it and the song is bloody about regrets and trying to make the future better.<br /> <br /> Continueing in the vein of easy-as-pie-to-place songs, I give you, <b>Alice In Chains - Them Bones:</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wFgAE5SgFnw\" data-code=\"wFgAE5SgFnw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/wFgAE5SgFnw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T12:15:46-07:00","id":174423,"title":"","content":"I could easily see it as a Geist or a Mummy song, so let's subvert expectation and call it a <b>Hunter The Vigil </b>song-a fatalistic song that explores the isolation and semi-futility of carrying the candle, that never the less moves at a grim but fast pace, calling for action regardless, to go onward even in nihilism. Who gives a shit if they die-that was always going to happen.<br /> <br /> I was thinking of a recent Fall Out Boy song for fun, but then I ran across this one-it's not great, but I got an unusual spin from it, and I wonder if anyone else will get the same vibe. Song is <b>Catch Fire</b> by <b>Jenix</b>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DpSARXWyCO4\" data-code=\"DpSARXWyCO4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/DpSARXWyCO4/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T12:34:48-07:00","id":174443,"title":"","content":"<b>Jenix - Catch Fire</b> kinda makes me think about Hunter, actually. The way she sings about rather fatalistic and hopeless things, that none the less needs to be overcome for the good of everything.<br /> There is no end to The Vigil, there are no heroes and it isn't a pleasant thing. Yet somebody needs to do it, and you know that you're amongst a very few people who can and will do something about it.<br /> Btw, nice spin on Them Bones. I liked that <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I have a very specific thing in mind with this next one. Lets see if the rest of you can guess what it is. I present; <b>Anglespit - Get Even:</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o1k-Gz1HxGI\" data-code=\"o1k-Gz1HxGI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/o1k-Gz1HxGI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T13:03:33-07:00","id":174487,"title":"","content":"I was thinking Mummy for Catch Fire, because my mind walks in circles when it's not walking in spirals.<br /> <br /> I'll let someone else play with Get Even.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T14:48:47-07:00","id":174582,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krobeles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=174443#post174443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o1k-Gz1HxGI\" data-code=\"o1k-Gz1HxGI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/o1k-Gz1HxGI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Avenger slashers, I would guess? Glorying in both revenge and the actual kill.<br /> <br /> Here's something that I'm sure will have an awesome personage attached to it: <b>Mr. Bad Example</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b0NlXKPaqZg&amp;feature=kp\" data-code=\"b0NlXKPaqZg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/b0NlXKPaqZg/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T14:58:36-07:00","id":174588,"title":"","content":"I don't know if this Krobeles sees but I hear in <b>Get Even</b> as an abyssal promise to destroy the fallen world. It revels in how it corrupts the magic mages &quot; your sharp intellect with crippling silence slip between the sheet stealthy compliance.&quot; It then goes on threat other supernaturals starting with changelings and other fae &quot; mandrake concentrate or I'll give you fucking sores&quot; moving on to vampires&quot; blood brother narcissism duplicity isn't new spit sister egotism watch me while I'll throttle you&quot; then on to prometheans &quot;full of frailty growing desperate to insanity in pervert flesh on a piece of plate scream out treachery everyone like to look the just want to see you dance on a meat hook&quot; . Then it focus on criticizing the Father, Psychopomp, Ruin ,and Raptor. God puppet beat a drum entertainment for the bored zombie doll with wings feasting on flesh evil siren sings casting the fat lot, vulture rip away scavenging parasite. Finally it takes a swipe at the uratha &quot;full blow soul decay under the sliver knife&quot;<br /> <br /> What do you see in The Storm ?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-IzVUOtMHa4\" data-code=\"-IzVUOtMHa4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/-IzVUOtMHa4/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1544,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1544-vectorfox","user":"VectorFox","date":". 06-19-2014, 06:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1544-vectorfox","name":"VectorFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1544_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T15:25:37-07:00","id":174620,"title":"","content":"<b>The Storm</b> - the theme for a <b>Changeling: The Lost</b> game set in the American South somewhere on Tornado Alley, where the characters know the lives they make are impermanent and unsafe, but they have to stay because when the Storm comes the Wild Hunt rides, and nobody else can stop them.<br /> <br /> I have some ideas of my own here, but...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_mTRvJ9fugM\" data-code=\"_mTRvJ9fugM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_mTRvJ9fugM/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T15:34:12-07:00","id":174626,"title":"","content":"<b>The Mother We Share</b>is a theme for two Prometheans who share a maker, trying to get buy in a world where they're the only one who will ever have the other's back, for better or worse.<br /> <br /> My offering is Tom Wait's <b>Rain Dogs</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MsuQj0ZGE6c\" data-code=\"MsuQj0ZGE6c\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/MsuQj0ZGE6c/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T16:02:44-07:00","id":174673,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>That Other Guy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=174626#post174626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>The Mother We Share</b>is a theme for two Prometheans who share a maker, trying to get buy in a world where they're the only one who will ever have the other's back, for better or worse.<br /> <br /> My offering is Tom Wait's <b>Rain Dogs</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MsuQj0ZGE6c\" data-code=\"MsuQj0ZGE6c\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/MsuQj0ZGE6c/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Seems to be about the supernatural denizens cheerfully divorcing themselves from mortality, recognizing they're something different, and cheerfully embracing that difference.<br /> <br /> Once again <b>Mr. Bad Example<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b0NlXKPaqZg\" data-code=\"b0NlXKPaqZg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/b0NlXKPaqZg/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></b><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T18:56:33-07:00","id":175673,"title":"","content":"Um, was that too hard? I can post something else if not.<br /> <br /> (praying other people reply, I like viewing new musical frontiers).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T02:11:10-07:00","id":175880,"title":"","content":"Well since I am responsible for you getting skipped over I suppose I will take a shot.<br /> <b>Mr. Bad example</b> is a classic example of a mage who has been eaten from the inside by his goetic demons. Greed seems to be in charge with lust vying for dominance<br /> <br /> Who or what is <b>The Harvester of Eyes </b>?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yu5bPJ-b6Nw\" data-code=\"yu5bPJ-b6Nw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/yu5bPJ-b6Nw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1544-vectorfox","name":"VectorFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1544_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T14:34:08-07:00","id":176430,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VectorFox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=175880#post175880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well since I am responsible for you getting skipped over I suppose I will take a shot.<br /> <b>Mr. Bad example</b> is a classic example of a mage who has been eaten from the inside by his goetic demons. Greed seems to be in charge with lust vying for dominance<br /> <br /> Who or what is <b>The Harvester of Eyes </b>?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yu5bPJ-b6Nw\" data-code=\"yu5bPJ-b6Nw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/yu5bPJ-b6Nw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>I get the idea of a changeling posing as a psychiatrist that bounces around in the dreams of the mental patients there. The emotions of some of the more zany patients are taking their effect on the changeling.<br /> <br /> See if anyone gets how I feel about this one as it may not be what you think at first. <b>Kamelot - The Human Stain</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4n3LobCY5HE\" data-code=\"4n3LobCY5HE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/4n3LobCY5HE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3342,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3342-alabamawookie","user":"AlabamaWookie","date":". 06-21-2014, 05:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3342-alabamawookie","name":"AlabamaWookie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T20:19:50-07:00","id":176666,"title":"","content":"<b>The Human Stain: </b>Initially, I thought it was about a Kindred Elder examining his unlife and realizing he misses mortality still, and now that I think about it - it's still Vampiric.<br /> <br /> <br /> So, just for the curveball, here's something I wasn't able to connect to any line in my head, but it's still awesome, so: <b>Protect the Law, by Iron Savior!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WgiomDEzyl0&amp;index=2&amp;list=FLuUHdYcTy3Kex2m1 XO-HZBA\" data-code=\"WgiomDEzyl0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/WgiomDEzyl0/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></b><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T23:21:07-07:00","id":176776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=176666#post176666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>The Human Stain: </b>Initially, I thought it was about a Kindred Elder examining his unlife and realizing he misses mortality still, and now that I think about it - it's still Vampiric.<br /> <br /> <br /> So, just for the curveball, here's something I wasn't able to connect to any line in my head, but it's still awesome, so: <b>Protect the Law, by Iron Savior!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WgiomDEzyl0&amp;index=2&amp;list=FLuUHdYcTy3Kex2m1 XO-HZBA\" data-code=\"WgiomDEzyl0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/WgiomDEzyl0/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></b></div> </div> </div> </div>Either the Guardians of the Veil, trying to hold Mage society together with duct-tape and twine.<br /> <br /> Or the Seers of the Throne. Upholding the Law of the Exarchs.<br /> <br /> While part of me wants to use &quot;If I Only Were a Goth&quot; by Thou Shalt Not, that's probably a bit meta, so instead have <b>They Know Me - Voltaire.</b><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cogk_2E6hDQ\" data-code=\"cogk_2E6hDQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/cogk_2E6hDQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As you are now, so once was I,<br /> As I am now, so you will be.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/285-andonno","name":"Andonno","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T00:49:46-07:00","id":176812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Andonno</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=176776#post176776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Either the Guardians of the Veil, trying to hold Mage society together with duct-tape and twine.<br /> <br /> Or the Seers of the Throne. Upholding the Law of the Exarchs.<br /> <br /> While part of me wants to use &quot;If I Only Were a Goth&quot; by Thou Shalt Not, that's probably a bit meta, so instead have <b>They Know Me - Voltaire.</b><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cogk_2E6hDQ\" data-code=\"cogk_2E6hDQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/cogk_2E6hDQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>My initial thought was a Kindred that visited the hospital to partake in &quot;happy meals&quot; with the drugged patients. However, I also got the idea of a Promethean just trying to get by though he feels that hes been cursed by life itself.<br /> <br /> <br /> Here's one by one of the new bands I've been listening to. Its actually written for the military but I can here some WoD in there. <b>Love and Death - By the Way</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r1Tc1nWHtjs\" data-code=\"r1Tc1nWHtjs\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/r1Tc1nWHtjs/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3342-alabamawookie","name":"AlabamaWookie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T11:02:27-07:00","id":177176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AlabamaWookie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=176812#post176812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's one by one of the new bands I've been listening to. Its actually written for the military but I can here some WoD in there. <b>Love and Death - By the Way</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Survivor's guilt is a theme which is applicable pretty much across the board, but if I were to pick a particular character type, I'm going to say that a hunter has lost a close friend or loved one, perhaps a cellmate, but just as likely an ordinary person lost to the darkness. Perhaps it's why the hunter took up the Vigil. More likely it's a consequence of having done so.<br /> <br /> This is a dense one. There's a lot to latch on here; take your pick. <b>Life: The Biggest Troll (Andrew Auernheimer)</b> by <b>Childish Gambino:</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_YFlXXto0aM\" data-code=\"_YFlXXto0aM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_YFlXXto0aM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> For your convenience, here's the <a href=\"http://rapgenius.com/Childish-gambino-life-the-biggest-troll-andrew-auernheimer-lyrics\" target=\"_blank\">Rap Genius page</a> unpacking this song.<br /> <br /> It's when you die<br /> It's when you die<br /> It's when you die<br /> It's when you die.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T19:26:21-07:00","id":225585,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=177176#post177176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Survivor's guilt is a theme which is applicable pretty much across the board, but if I were to pick a particular character type, I'm going to say that a hunter has lost a close friend or loved one, perhaps a cellmate, but just as likely an ordinary person lost to the darkness. Perhaps it's why the hunter took up the Vigil. More likely it's a consequence of having done so.<br /> <br /> This is a dense one. There's a lot to latch on here; take your pick. <b>Life: The Biggest Troll (Andrew Auernheimer)</b> by <b>Childish Gambino:</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_YFlXXto0aM\" data-code=\"_YFlXXto0aM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_YFlXXto0aM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> For your convenience, here's the <a href=\"http://rapgenius.com/Childish-gambino-life-the-biggest-troll-andrew-auernheimer-lyrics\" target=\"_blank\">Rap Genius page</a> unpacking this song.<br /> <br /> It's when you die<br /> It's when you die<br /> It's when you die<br /> It's when you die.</div> </div> </div> </div>(you weren't kidding, it took me several months).<br /> <br /> The theme song for the nWoD.<br /> <br /> It's a miserable place, a bitter place, and in the end Death is the most powerful force. But Death isn't cruel, and just because it's horrible doesn't mean there's nothing to be done except tear it apart for mistreating you; if you've done that, you're no better than the people who profit from the misery, and in fact you've just proven how incredibly immature and self-centered you are, being one of the people making things worse all around. Life is hard and short; let's make that shortness as happy as we can.<br /> <br /> Here's a classic I'm pretty sure any gamer will take the easy way out with: The venerable <b>Mantis Hymn!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eMasLUmBzkc\" data-code=\"eMasLUmBzkc\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/eMasLUmBzkc/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></b><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T20:06:16-07:00","id":225602,"title":"","content":"Ahahah, oh man, I'd totally planned to come back to this thread and answer that one myself if it looked like it was holding up the thread, I'd just forgotten. I need to perform penance for dropping a thick song like that and stalling the thread out now.<br /> <br /> <b>Mantis's Hymn,</b> divorced from the context of a flying bald man who reads your memory card, is a lament. Not only is the song itself dirgelike, soft, low and deep, but it rings hollow. The choral accompaniment (and it sounds like an accompaniment; no one set of instruments really takes center stage in the hymn) is unreal, imitative. It's just a synthesizer, as is everything else about the hymn. Ghostly, sad and strange, colorless and tired. This is the caliber of music you will hear in the majority of the Autochthonous Depths when outsiders have not brought life to intrude upon that dark place.<br /> <br /> Softball. Easier song. Simpler. Tell me who's calling for <b>Mr. Ambulance Driver:</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tEWViGmX8Lw\" data-code=\"tEWViGmX8Lw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/tEWViGmX8Lw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T08:24:00-07:00","id":225991,"title":"","content":"The beast/evil within is expressed on this <b>Slipknot</b>'s song about that impulse that, no matter what you do to try to hide it, it will always reach the surface<br /> <br /> Themes like the <b>beast</b>, <b>first change </b>or the <b>promethean </b>condition can be related to it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jVq__fV9B4c\" data-code=\"jVq__fV9B4c\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/jVq__fV9B4c/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>English is not my native language, sorry guys.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/607-amadeu","name":"Amadeu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T06:55:55-07:00","id":226989,"title":"","content":"Amadeu, I think you misunderstood the premise of the thread. You're supposed to interpret the song posted by the one before you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=225602#post225602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Softball. Easier song. Simpler. Tell me who's calling for <b>Mr. Ambulance Driver:</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tEWViGmX8Lw\" data-code=\"tEWViGmX8Lw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/tEWViGmX8Lw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Hm, I'm thinking of Geist the Sin-Eaters. Two people are killed. One of them is offered a deal by a geist. He accepts, but then regrets it, wishing the other person would have been offered a second chance instead.<br /> <br /> And since this one was apparently skipped, I'll do that one too.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Andonno</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=176776#post176776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While part of me wants to use &quot;If I Only Were a Goth&quot; by Thou Shalt Not, that's probably a bit meta, so instead have <b>They Know Me - Voltaire.</b><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cogk_2E6hDQ\" data-code=\"cogk_2E6hDQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/cogk_2E6hDQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Ooh, I love Voltaire. Though this one is difficult, mainly because I'm not quite sure what it's about. Though I do get a demon-y vibe from it. In particular the song is about the cover. &quot;They know me&quot;, well yes, they do know you, they just don't know that they've only really known you for a few minutes.<br /> <br /> As for my song, it might be kind of obvious, but it'll be interesting to see what the rest of you can come up with about Emilie Autumn - Opheliac.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XX05JOouhJU\" data-code=\"XX05JOouhJU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/XX05JOouhJU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/941-sahrimnir","name":"Sahrimnir","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T08:42:06-07:00","id":227055,"title":"","content":"I always recommend this for Changeling - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xok3CGNPSE0\" target=\"_blank\">Queen II by Queen.</a><br /> <br /> The track titles alone can make it clear:<br /> <br /> White Side (Side One) <br /> 1. &quot;Procession&quot; (Instrumental) <br /> 2. &quot;Father to Son&quot; <br /> 3. &quot;White Queen (As It Began)&quot; <br /> 4. &quot;Some Day One Day&quot; <br /> 5. &quot;The Loser in the End&quot; <br /> Black Side (Side Two) <br /> 1. &quot;Ogre Battle&quot; <br /> 2. &quot;The Fairy Feller's Master-Stroke&quot; <br /> 3. &quot;Nevermore&quot; <br /> 4. &quot;The March of the Black Queen&quot; <br /> 5. &quot;Funny How Love Is&quot; <br /> 6. &quot;Seven Seas of Rhye&quot; <br /> <br /> One of these days, I'm going to finish my idea of a Durance based on this album.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-18T20:25:40-07:00","id":1150881,"title":"","content":"I just realized that cloning the thread wasn't necessary, and continuing this is probably better.<br /> <br /> So, Opheliac is about a vampiress who's sick of the Masquerade pretending at Humanity and announcing her intention to embrace being a monster true to herself as an Acolyte.<br /> <br /> So, for good music from mediocre anime, I have the english cover of aLIEz by AmaLee.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9G9CPZ8Zd7k\" data-code=\"9G9CPZ8Zd7k\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/9G9CPZ8Zd7k/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-18T21:21:53-07:00","id":1150890,"title":"","content":"A group of Iron Masters facing the reality that the war against their kin is forever futile, yet they must watch as their friends and loved ones keep throwing themselves into it and they try to put on a face that they too still support the fight.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, what does it mean when <b>I've Pursued Nothing</b>?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GPXXfxpQ94\" data-code=\"_GPXXfxpQ94\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_GPXXfxpQ94/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":483,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","user":"Flyboy254","date":". 10-19-2017, 07:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T07:46:34-07:00","id":1151000,"title":"","content":"I know lyrics aren't everything, but can we have a rule that we try to put up lyrics videos of the songs if we can?<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'd use it as the theme of a potential pact signee your <b>Demon</b> players meet up with who feels he has wasted his life.<br /> <br /> For an unexpectedly upbeat challenge, how would you use <i>History Maker</i>?<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/L3yHWOFDXIo\" data-code=\"L3yHWOFDXIo\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/L3yHWOFDXIo/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Feel free to say it's too specific to the show","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T17:01:57-07:00","id":1151157,"title":"","content":"If is the key word there.<br /> <br /> Maybe a bit of a softball answer, but definitely a song about a princess nakama setting off on a mission that would finally deal a crushing blow to the darkness.<br /> <br /> The question is, what happens during <b>Midnight in the Desert?</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-cmUpgvmFk4\" data-code=\"-cmUpgvmFk4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/-cmUpgvmFk4/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T18:26:46-07:00","id":1151169,"title":"","content":"Prometheans singing about the Pilgrimage, I think. Really insomniac Prometheans.<br /> <br /> Okay, time to get metal in this business. Tell me, are you <b>Afraid of the Dark</b>?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sWAgYVhiabo\" data-code=\"sWAgYVhiabo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/sWAgYVhiabo/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T18:56:06-07:00","id":1151174,"title":"","content":"A Darkling in progress, being turned into some Keeper's personal assassin/bogeyman bit by bit. Probably a Hunterheart.<br /> <br /> Multiple people can answer this one, as I want to see if anyone had a different idea from mine. Or maybe just a more specific one<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/r2Uab6qzM9s\" data-code=\"r2Uab6qzM9s\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/r2Uab6qzM9s/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxp