;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bxogS37IoM8\" data-code=\"bxogS37IoM8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/bxogS37IoM8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-13T19:14:10-08:00","id":1158317,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna say it's not about a sin-eater, but the sin-eater's significant other stressing out about the fact that they're watching the one they love embark on (what looks like) a self-destructive course, and that they can't take it much longer.<br /> <br /> Now, let's <b>Word Up!</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6sI-BzCK9Qk\" data-code=\"6sI-BzCK9Qk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6sI-BzCK9Qk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-13T21:36:41-08:00","id":1158349,"title":"","content":"I don't have a specific splat to pin it to, but I'd use it for a tough guy or group of tough guys who just got embraced/had the First Change/Awakened/got back from Arcadia having a bar fight where they get to revel in their new supernatural powers (covert ones at least) on some drunken assholes. Of course, this is a horror game, so at some point they're going to see what those injuries did to them in the long run and how all their relatives are out for revenge.<br /> <br /> Now, who will run down <b>The Slip Kid</b>?<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-DsOfKsBJ8c\" data-code=\"-DsOfKsBJ8c\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/-DsOfKsBJ8c/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 11-14-2017, 10:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T13:21:24-08:00","id":1159146,"title":"","content":"Definitely some 70s Mages, Free Council-types, preparing to fight the Seers, and when told by the Diamond Orders to stand aside, they put their foot down and demand to be part of the fighting, because they're an Order just the same and aren't going to be put in time out while the 'adults' settle this. They didn't Awaken just to be silenced by the Seers or the Diamond, and they'll be damned if they get treated like Sleepers.<br /> <br /> Sometimes I feel like I just <b>Floated In</b>, like a leaf on the wind.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9MDfRR_wUpE\" data-code=\"9MDfRR_wUpE\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/9MDfRR_wUpE/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/19270-princevertigo","name":"PrinceVertigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar19270_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T13:44:58-08:00","id":1159161,"title":"","content":"Sounds like to me like the theme of a fairly casual day as a Spring Courtier-no worries, just enjoying the world while occasionally wondering if life was better beyond the Hedge, where things were so very dream-like.<br /> <br /> Now on to things that might be actual ambient music in a CofD show or game: Tell me, have you heard the Testament?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\">