l-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1279833#post1279833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I see a tempter demon who is EXTREMELY close to having an angel fall, and is now on the climax of his ploy, showing the angel all that he can experience as a demon.<br /> <br /> this song is sort of like the dark mirror to my way. <a href=\"https://youtu.be/GQIAcztYjbc\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/GQIAcztYjbc</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This one was pretty hard because it focuses on a man regretting wasted time in his old age and a lot of the splats either live violent lives that don't last long or have some way to live far beyond a human lifespan. But Changelings can eventually die, so I think this fits as a song an old Spring Court dandy sings as age catches up with even his magical form and he sees how shallow all his relationships were in his lust for pleasure and Glamour.<br /> <br /> Now, hard mode. See if you can connect this song to its music video and then place both in a Chronicles of Darkness context.<br /> <br /> Trigger Warning: Violence against Children, Torture<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r5dNcKTcnPA\" data-code=\"r5dNcKTcnPA\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/r5dNcKTcnPA/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-11T08:31:38-08:00","id":1280119,"title":"","content":"Currently working on a retro-style re-imagining of the New World of Darkness/Chronicles of Darkness, using the 1e nWoD rules.<br /> <br /> It eschews the modern Gothic aesthetic and instead pursues a nostalgic retro aesthetic heavily inspired by the pop culture and consumerism of the 1980's and 1990's. It's even set in Miami Beach in the year 199X for that extra touch.<br /> <br /> Essentially, this new chronicle setting is like &quot;World of Darkness meets Vaporwave aesthetics&quot; or &quot;Vice City with Fangs&quot; and it incorporates Vampire, Hunter, Changeling, and Princess.<br /> <br /> Werewolf, Mage, Promethean and Geist would be canon but not playable while Demon and Beast are explicitly excised from the setting and declared non-canon.<br /> <br /> The soundtrack would be mostly pop hits of the 1980's and 1990's, like the following...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SzcnWPcBNCE\" data-code=\"SzcnWPcBNCE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/SzcnWPcBNCE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DGXifeNWDpQ\" data-code=\"DGXifeNWDpQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/DGXifeNWDpQ/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1579,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","user":"Camilla","date":". 01-11-2019, 11:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-11T08:35:10-08:00","id":1280120,"title":"","content":"That sounds actually kinda amazingly awesome and I will keep an eye on that project, but it's a bit off-topic for this thread. I understand that the thread should probably be renamed to reflect this, but the purpose is to play a game described by the thread creator as such:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness#post171166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To put it simply, I link a music video or mp3, then the poster below me describes a thing nWoD that could have that song as a theme. Then <i>they </i>link a theme, and the poster below them describes something that