ory/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1280517#post1280517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would say it's a desperate human who's has been spirit urged, but is very aware of what's happening and is soon to be claimed. also will be listening to your next music soon<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12845_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12845\" data-vbnamecard=\"12845\">ahather</a>, from the video alone, I see a ventrue (or perhaps a daeva) with malkavia. do you want an answer from lyrics alone too?<br /> <br /> how about this <a href=\"https://youtu.be/yERildSsWxM\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/yERildSsWxM</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hm. The melancholic mood puts me in the sense of a dying mentor, so I say a Pariah advising the new generation of hunters that they can't seal away their pain and expect to still be functional as hunters or human beings.<br /> <br /> Something a bit more obscure, but with a mood that sounds very CofD:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W1wABGVIALw\" data-code=\"W1wABGVIALw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/W1wABGVIALw/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-15T07:10:42-08:00","id":1280892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1280605#post1280605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Hm. The melancholic mood puts me in the sense of a dying mentor, so I say a Pariah advising the new generation of hunters that they can't seal away their pain and expect to still be functional as hunters or human beings.<br /> <br /> Something a bit more obscure, but with a mood that sounds very CofD:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W1wABGVIALw\" data-code=\"W1wABGVIALw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/W1wABGVIALw/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I see a Non-Sin-Eater Bound who doesn't believe the Underworld can be saved but still follows the Fury ideology to get ghosts out of his head, but at the same time is a bit disturbed by the idea that he is a ghostly abomination puppeting a warm corpse.<br /> <br /> Now, how about we take a trip into my <b>Roaring 20s</b>?<br /> <br /> EDIT: embedding isn't working.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HWSqv-xsc5o\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HWSqv-xsc5o\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HWSqv-xsc5o\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HWSqv-xsc5o </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-20T13:10:26-07:00","id":1375848,"title":"","content":"I imagine a changeling that was forced to leave their old life behind, and maybe is still questioning somewhat if they ever got out of arcadia.<br /> <br /> Here's something chill for the next one.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eDW_yAwaHnc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eDW_yAwaHnc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eDW_yAwaHnc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eDW_yAwaHnc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11554-fate-inker","name":"Fate Inker","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-20T14:15:19-07:00","id":1375858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fate Inker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1375848#post1375848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I imagine a changeling that was forced to leave their old life behind, and maybe is still questioning somewhat if they ever got out of arcadia.<br /> <br /> Here's something chill for the next one.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eDW_yAwaHnc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eDW_yAwaHnc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eDW_yAwaHnc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eDW_yAwaHnc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm, I would say this is a nosferatu, a newly embraced one, finally coming into terms that his...condition has everyone behaving differently around him, even to the point of disassociating with him.<br /> <br /> How about this song<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=y5ecvBaqHBk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=y5ecvBaqHBk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=y5ecvBaqHBk\" target=\"_blank\"> https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=y5ecvBaqHBk </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-20T17:55:04-07:00","id":1375878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1375858#post1375858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmm, I would say this is a nosferatu, a newly embraced one, finally coming into terms that his...condition has everyone behaving differently around him, even to the point of disassociating with him.<br /> <br /> How about this song<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=y5ecvBaqHBk\" target=\"_blank\">https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=y5ecvBaqHBk</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Seems to me like it's an Arisen reflecting on his best Descent, and feeling nostalgic for a time only he remembers perfectly now that he recalls it.<br /> <br /> And now, for out-of-place cheer!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mq3iRf8QA28\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mq3iRf8QA28\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mq3iRf8QA28\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mq3iRf8QA28 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-20T22:16:39-07:00","id":1375901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1375878#post1375878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Seems to me like it's an Arisen reflecting on his best Descent, and feeling nostalgic for a time only he remembers perfectly now that he recalls it.<br /> <br /> And now, for out-of-place cheer!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mq3iRf8QA28\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mq3iRf8QA28</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Very nice take with it being that of an Arisen<br /> <br /> Anyway, for your song, I would say it's a beast. A beast making it a point that he knows his brood is composed of monsters, but that theres more to them than that. While at the same time, telling the Hero that he is the degenerate and the consequences of his actions will catch up with him.<br /> <br /> I dont know what it is...but<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=raNGeq3_DtM&amp;list=PLCD0445C57F2B7F41&amp;index=16&amp;t=0s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"h