code_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fate Inker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/171166-musical-themes-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1375984#post1375984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thats totally a promethean who's been on their journey for some time, is possibly getting close to the end, desperately wants an answer to this question of human connection known as love, and has found someone that their convinced can teach them.<br /> <br /> This isn't the original cover but I think this ones better.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UFjn67oZ9-Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UFjn67oZ9-Q</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, I'm sorry if this is repetitive, but what I see is a Beast, and a collector at that, unabashedly telling a Hero that she knows what she wants to do, does not care if the Hero thinks she is wrong, and then runs off while letting the Hero try and catch her<br /> <br /> Alternatively I see a Mage, maybe nameless or apostate, on the run from Keeper of the viel. Maybe she has low wisdom, or enough wisdom to see something others dont, and she is inviting the Keeper to try and catch her, for she will stop at nothing to achieve her goal.<br /> <br /> Ok, its somewhere over the rainbow. A very epic rainbow<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UFjn67oZ9-Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UFjn67oZ9-Q</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-0